y: none;\">0002520000</span>2,520<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Crucible\" title=\"The Crucible\">The Crucible</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Vrall_the_Fearless\" title=\"Vrall the Fearless\">Vrall</a>'s chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bluff\" title=\"Bluff\">Bluff +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bluff\" title=\"Bluff\">Bluff +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Bluff\" title=\"Bluff\">Bluff</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +2</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +2 Enhancement modifier to your attack bonus and a +3 Enhancement bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Backstabber%27s_Gloves_(Level_11).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Backstabber%27s_Gloves_%28Level_11%29.png/420px-Backstabber%27s_Gloves_%28Level_11%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Backstabber%27s_Gloves_%28Level_11%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>These leather gloves were once worn by Vrall the Fearless of the Cloven-Jaw. They are soaked with the blood of his enemies... or perhaps his allies.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNew